              "help": {
                "text": "A stack buffer overflow was found in Internationl components for unicode (ICU ). While running the genrb binary, the 'subtag' struct overflowed at the SRBRoot::addTag function. This issue may lead to memory corruption and local arbitrary code execution.\n",
                "markdown": "> A stack buffer overflow was found in Internationl components for unicode (ICU ). While running the genrb binary, the 'subtag' struct overflowed at the SRBRoot::addTag function. This issue may lead to memory corruption and local arbitrary code execution.\n\n|                                                                                                    |\n|Package         pkg:deb/ubuntu/icu@74.2-1ubuntu3.1?os_distro=noble&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=24.04  |\n|Affected range  >=0                                                                                 |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                           |\n"
