              "help": {
                "text": "libexpat in Expat before 2.7.2 allows attackers to trigger large dynamic memory allocations via a small document that is submitted for parsing.\n",
                "markdown": "> libexpat in Expat before 2.7.2 allows attackers to trigger large dynamic memory allocations via a small document that is submitted for parsing.\n\n|                                                                                                       |\n|Package         pkg:deb/ubuntu/expat@2.6.1-2ubuntu0.4?os_distro=noble&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=24.04  |\n|Affected range  >=0                                                                                    |\n|Fixed version   not fixed                                                                              |\n"
