              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-6368?s=ubuntu&n=glibc&ns=ubuntu&t=deb&osn=ubuntu&osv=24.04&vr=%3C2.39-0ubuntu8.9",
              "help": {
                "text": "Calling wordexp with WRDE_APPEND in the GNU C Library version 2.0 to version 2.43 can cause the interface to return invalid memory in the we_wordv member, which on subsequent calls to wordfree may abort the process.\n",
                "markdown": "> Calling wordexp with WRDE_APPEND in the GNU C Library version 2.0 to version 2.43 can cause the interface to return invalid memory in the we_wordv member, which on subsequent calls to wordfree may abort the process.\n\n|                                                                                                      |\n|Package         pkg:deb/ubuntu/glibc@2.39-0ubuntu8.8?os_distro=noble&os_name=ubuntu&os_version=24.04  |\n|Affected range  <2.39-0ubuntu8.9                                                                      |\n|Fixed version   2.39-0ubuntu8.9                                                                       |\n"
